# MAX BLUEPRINT — ARTWORK INCORPORATION

Three paste targets for DeepSeek. Each is self-contained.

---

## PASTE A — PORTAL LOGIN CREST + ART HERO (all 3 portals)

**What changes:**
1. Login crest: `badge-tiger.svg` → `NET-LION-VOICE-4.png` — students see OBI's face when they unlock
2. SetPw modal icon: same swap
3. Dashboard art hero: `mouse-tiger-confidence.png` as a full-width card below the mode cards — this is the visual statement of the entire program

**CSS to add** (into each portal's `<style>` block, near `.content-card`):

```css
/* Transformation art card */
.art-hero-card {
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.18);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background: var(--card);
    animation: fadeIn 0.7s ease;
}
.art-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    opacity: 0.88;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
}
.art-hero-card:hover .art-hero-img { opacity: 1; }
.art-hero-caption {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.12);
}
.art-hero-caption .caption-title {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
.art-hero-caption .caption-sub {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-top: 3px;
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .art-hero-img { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
}
```

**Login crest change** — find in each portal:
```html
<img src="/icons/badge-tiger.svg" alt="Tiger Badge" class="login-crest"
```
Replace with:
```html
<img src="/assessment-assets/brand/NET-LION-VOICE-4.png" alt="OBI" class="login-crest"
     style="border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.35);box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(168,85,247,0.2);"
```

**SetPw modal icon** — same swap (second occurrence of badge-tiger.svg if present).

**Art hero placement** — insert AFTER the `<!-- Mode Cards -->` div closing tag and BEFORE `<!-- Weekly Progress Widget -->`:

```html
<!-- Transformation Art Hero -->
<div class="art-hero-card">
    <img class="art-hero-img"
         src="https://net-art-arsenal.pages.dev/thumbs/artwork/mouse-tiger-confidence.webp"
         alt="Mouse Voice to Tiger Voice"
         loading="lazy"
         onerror="this.src='https://net-art-arsenal.pages.dev/artwork/mouse-tiger-confidence.png'">
    <div class="art-hero-caption">
        <div class="caption-title">Mouse Voice → Tiger Voice</div>
        <div class="caption-sub">Your transformation. Every session counts.</div>
    </div>
</div>
```

*Note: Uses `/thumbs/` path first (WebP, smaller) with fallback to full PNG via onerror.*

**For Quy specifically** — caption-sub should be Vietnamese: `Sự chuyển hóa của bạn. Mỗi buổi học đều quan trọng.`

