## PASTE B — PORTAL WATERMARK UPGRADE

Current watermark is `badge-tiger.svg` at 5.5% opacity fixed bottom-right. Upgrade to the phoenix logo for more visual identity.

Find in each portal:
```html
<img class="portal-watermark"
```
The `src` attribute currently points to `/icons/badge-tiger.svg`. Change to:
```html
<img class="portal-watermark"
     src="/assessment-assets/brand/NET-PHXRISING-LOGO.webp"
     alt=""
     aria-hidden="true">
```

No CSS change needed — existing `.portal-watermark { opacity: 0.055; width: 280px; ... }` is correct.

