## WHAT STUDENTS SEE TONIGHT (full picture)

**Login screen:** OBI's lion face as the crest. Not a generic badge. That face IS the product.

**Dashboard:** OBI's face replaced by lion on mode unlock. Three mode cards with art arsenal icons. Then directly below — the full `mouse-tiger-confidence.png` transformation artwork with the caption "Mouse Voice → Tiger Voice." That's the program's core philosophy visible the moment they land.

**Bottom-right watermark:** Phoenix Rising logo ghosted at 5.5% opacity. Visible on close look, subtle on first pass.

**OBI chat session:** Gemini concept art as tinted background on the landing mode-select screen. Phoenix watermark behind the conversation.

**Quy specifically:** Vietnamese sub-labels on mode cards + Vietnamese transformation caption. She sees her language. Huong and Mai Tram see English — they're at the level to read it.

